    "detailed_description": "The truth about the horror and tragedy hidden in an abandoned ryokan. You step into an abandoned ryokan where ghosts wander about, and you will discover the mystery of a terrible tragedy that occurred in the past. The ghost of a maid who once worked there still wanders the inn and drags visitors into the depths of fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will be forced to make the ultimate choice: to search through the horror-filled inn and collect hidden clues, or to release the spirit or release the grudge. Will you be able to escape the inn safely?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this horror adventure game with multiple endings, the choices you make will greatly affect the outcome of the story. In the beautiful and eerie Japanese-style world of the inn, your decisions will determine the fate of the inn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you survive the horror of the inn - or will you be trapped forever?",
    "about_the_game": "The truth about the horror and tragedy hidden in an abandoned ryokan. You step into an abandoned ryokan where ghosts wander about, and you will discover the mystery of a terrible tragedy that occurred in the past. The ghost of a maid who once worked there still wanders the inn and drags visitors into the depths of fear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will be forced to make the ultimate choice: to search through the horror-filled inn and collect hidden clues, or to release the spirit or release the grudge. Will you be able to escape the inn safely?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this horror adventure game with multiple endings, the choices you make will greatly affect the outcome of the story. In the beautiful and eerie Japanese-style world of the inn, your decisions will determine the fate of the inn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you survive the horror of the inn - or will you be trapped forever?",
    "short_description": "An abandoned inn where lost souls wander, your decision will determine its outcome.",
